  "question": {
    "html": "<p>Monochromatic light of wavelength <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"600\"></span> nm is incident on a double slit and produces an interference pattern on a screen, located at a distance of <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"2.0\"></span> m from the slits.</p>\n\n<figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure>\n\n<p>What is true about the effect of single-slit diffraction on the pattern and what is the distance between the slits?</p>\n\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td></td>\n<td>\n<p><strong>Effect of single-slit diffraction</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><strong>Distance between the slits</strong></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-label=\"A\">\n<td><strong>A.</strong></td>\n<td>Negligible</td>\n<td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"60 \\: \\mu\"></span>m</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-label=\"B\">\n<td><strong>B.</strong></td>\n<td>Negligible</td>\n<td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"30 \\: \\mu\"></span>m</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-label=\"C\">\n<td><strong>C.</strong></td>\n<td>Significant</td>\n<td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"60 \\: \\mu\"></span>m</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-label=\"D\">\n<td><strong>D.</strong></td>\n<td>Significant</td>\n<td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"30 \\: \\mu\"></span>m</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>"
  },
